WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:42.500
Russia... it's cold!

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:45.750
Well, the cold is still better than staying on a ship.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:03.020
We of the BBA team are heading to Russia, where the finals of the Beyblade World Tournament are being held.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:09.850
Looking back upon our previous battles,
I realized we still have room for growth.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:16.030
If we don't overcome our weaknesses and
hone our power, we won't be able to win the finals.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.320
Boo!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.940
What's the big idea, Takao?!

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:24.270
Is this a problem? I was looking for you all over!

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.620
Why are you watching this?

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:32.760
I was psychologically preparing for
our imminent arrival in Russia, is all...

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.010
Russia?

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:37.590
Imminent? What are you on about, Professor?

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.640
We're all still...

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.960
in the middle of the sea!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.630
Aw, seasick? Seriously?

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:52.570
Those Who Subjugate
the Sacred Beasts.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:03:01.200
I'd hoped that thinking over the final tournament in Russia would take my mind off the seasickness...

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.080
So that's why you were
watching Russian landscapes on TV!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.230
I was trying to ease my mind, but it didn't work...

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.060
There's still a week to go before we arrive. It's not going to be fun.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:17.720
How simple of you, Professor! I know of a better way to get over your seasickness.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.370
Come with me, Professor.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.140
A pool right on the ship. Awesome, isn't it?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.370
Cruiser ships are really the best.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:34.580
If you swim to your heart's content, you'll forget about your condition before long.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.530
What's wrong with you, Takao?!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:41.070
We're not here on vacation!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.100
The World Championship finals are all but imminent!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.670
We can't afford to waste time fooling around!

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:50.980
Whoa, nice form!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.460
That's..!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.390
I'll Go... Shoot into your heart!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.400
Just kidding!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.610
Max...

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.890
He's good...

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.230
Woo, Laura!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.590
Oh, seasickness?

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:10.330
Yep. That's why I brought him here.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.530
Okay! I know of a much better way to get rid of it.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:18.070
Here you'll find a first-class French restaurant.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:22.480
With a full course meal, your
seasickness'll be gone in a jiffy.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:26.310
Sounds good to me!
I was just getting hungry myself.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.800
How can you be so relaxed at a time like this?!

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:36.000
Listen up and listen closely. We're about to go into the final round of the World Tournament.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:41.290
There, we'll be going up against Bladers infinitely stronger than those we've faced before.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.690
Now's not the time to stuff our faces all willy-nilly!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.310
Ah, I'm full.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.770
Oh, you guys are eating here, too?

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.010
Well, about that...

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.670
Seasickness?

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:56.520
That's all? I know a way to get rid of it like <i>bam</i>!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:57.760
Follow me.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.280
Wow, amazing!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.300
An arcade!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.780
This ship has everything, huh?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:07.120
How is this supposed to
help me overcome seasickness?!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.040
Over here, now.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.000
Keep going!

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.920
A Bey stadium!

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:18.390
Oh? These guys look pretty strong!

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:23.210
If you casually battle with these guys, you're sure to get some training done.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.520
By focusing on gathering data, you'll forget all about it.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.400
This is getting me all fired up!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.400
Let's do this.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.120
Yeah.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.400
Please wait!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:38.070
No matter how strong they may look, they're amateurs! It won't serve as training!

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.310
Still better than nothing, no?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.570
There's something else I want you to do!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.100
Something else..?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:55.480
It's actually something President Daitenji
asked me to do before he left for Russia in advance.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.430
Old man Daitenji did?

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:06.180
In short, it's to unify the team, and to get you in tip-top shape in preparation for the finals.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:12.490
That's it?! The team is already united, and we're in perfect condition as-is.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.610
We're ready to the finals whenever!

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.910
You know nothing, Takao.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.240
What are you saying?!

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:22.100
I'm trying to say that you haven't
learned anything from your battles!

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:26.200
Sure, we made our way here through a series of intense battles,

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.360
but that doesn't necessarily mean that we're strong enough!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.370
So what's your point?

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.990
The other night at the cafe,
I went over our past battles.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:39.290
As a result, I soon came to a realization.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.560
That being?

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.370
This.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.930
Oh, that brings me back!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:48.550
That battle is from before Kai had joined us!

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.600
Go, Fire Arrow!

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.480
Tiger Claw!

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:00.200
What?!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.230
Touchdown!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:10.090
Hey, stop right there! Why are you only showing the lame parts?!

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:12.240
What did you realize, exactly?!

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.570
You still don't get it? I'll explain.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.330
You've won your battles, and that's why you're here.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.670
But at the same time, you've also lost your fair share!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:27.870
If the tournament used a single-round system instead of a three-round one,

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:31.420
could you still say you would have made it all the way here?

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:33.440
T-That's, well...

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:35.530
The same goes for the rest of you!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:42.770
In the finals of the Asian Tournament, you almost got Driger destroyed by Lai's attacks.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:50.380
Max, in the finals of the World Tournament's A-Block, you were at a huge disadvantage to the PPB's scientific power.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:55.920
In the end, both of you won,
but you were so close to losing!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.320
In other words, we're still far from perfect!

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:03.920
If we aren't aware of our shortcomings,
we can't hope to win in the Finals!

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:10.470
That's why I'd like to suggest some custom-fit training for everyone.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.970
Custom-fit training?

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:19.660
I've extracted your weak points by looking through past data, devising a strengthening schedule for each of you.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:23.390
I will have you undergo training following said schedules.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.610
If we want to challenge the world's best, we have to minimize our weaknesses.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:32.100
<i>This</i> is what unifying the team and perfecting your conditions is about.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:36.120
Understood, Professor! I'll follow
whatever you've got lined up for me!

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:37.910
Then let's start with you, Max.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:45.400
To improve the attack power of your impregnable fortress, Draciel, I'd like you to train your muscles.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:48.890
There's a gym on the second
floor, so you can do so there.

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:50.390
<i>Okay!</i>

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.050
As for you, Takao.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.880
Yeah, lay it on me!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.130
You should do some jogging.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:09:00.160
Eh, jogging? That's pretty lame...

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:04.070
What you need the most is composure and patience.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.850
You'll have to endure my plain and solitary training.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:15.570
Twenty laps around the promenade deck. The ship is 250 meters long,  so it comes out to about 10 kilometers.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.530
Tch. Alright, alright.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:19.630
Next up is Rei.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:25.560
That's enough, thanks. Following another's instructions is not to my taste.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.630
I'll train on my own.

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:30.490
Well, fair enough.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.640
Oh, right. Where's Kai?

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:46.060
I'll be at the top of the world.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.140
Go! Do your best!

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.400
Don't give up!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.170
Keep going!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.160
What's your deal?

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:00.240
Why do you keep watching our battles so closely?

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:05.180
Do you want to battle with us? If that's the case, I'll take you on myself.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:05.800
Hey!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.430
Wait!

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:18.200
What you need the most is composure and patience.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.100
You'll have to endure my plain and solitary training.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.440
I'll endure it, alright! I'll stand atop the rest of the world!

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.470
This is so freaking boring!

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:50.720
I can't keep doing this crap any longer! When I think of training...

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.990
...I think of battles!

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:57.010
What's going on?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.510
W-What is this mess?!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:06.530
W-What the heck happened in here?!

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:08.390
Why are all these Beys like this?!

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:11.960
It's him! He destroyed all our Beys!

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.280
Wait! I'll take you on!

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.780
I'll avenge the others!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:27.040
Let's do this! Go... Shoot!

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:56.810
My Bey... My poor Bey...

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.610
Wait!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:12.170
You're despicable! How could you destroy their Beys like this?! And you dare call yourself a Blader?!

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.750
Say something, will you?! Huh?!

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.130
Get your hands off me.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.710
You misunderstand.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:26.850
I simply accepted their challenge.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.350
As soon as I started playing against them, more and more challengers showed up.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:36.800
Mass hysteria. It's a common
occurrence in crowded places.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.680
Whatever the reason, you went too far!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.290
Who the hack are you?!

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:44.610
Really... Ill-mannered people are a real annoyance.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.790
What was that?!

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:52.790
It's common etiquette to introduce yourself before asking for another's name, yes?

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.300
My name is Takao Kinomiya!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.430
Takao Kinomiya...

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:04.080
Kinomiya... You mean <i>that</i> Takao Kinomiya, from the BBA team who won in America?

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.210
Maybe he can do it!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:07.800
Did I, by any chance, become famous?

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:10.510
You're our only hope, Takao Kinomiya.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.830
Avenge us!

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.700
You bet I will! Leave it to me.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:20.010
You, square up! I'll show
you the true spirit of Beyblade!

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:29.070
I'll pass. My Bey would become tainted fighting such a coarse Bey.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.240
Plus, the party for first-class
passengers is about to start.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.120
I have no more time to waste with the likes of you.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.470
Running away, are you? Coward!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.480
Now, now...

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:44.760
You just had to utter the word I despise the most.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.850
Your luck is pitiful.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:54.360
I still don't feel too good...

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.560
I wonder... Are the others training as I told them to?

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:00.570
Hey, a crazy battle is about to go down at the stadium!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:04.020
Even here, the world-renowned love for Beyblade shows!

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:04.660
I heard one of them is
Takao Kinomiya of the BBA team!
Even here, the world-renowned love for Beyblade shows!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:07.250
I heard one of them is
Takao Kinomiya of the BBA team!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.240
T-Takao?!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.080
A crazy battle is about to start!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.530
Takao Kinomiya of the BBA is facing a mysterious Blader!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.500
Takao Kinomiya is going to fight!

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.220
The other guy is super strong, too!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.760
Takao..?

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.970
<i>What?!</i>

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:39.000
Takao, what are you doing down here?!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:47.320
Don't try and stop me, Professor! I'm about to teach this guy about the spirit of Beyblade!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.630
What on Earth?!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.280
T-That's...

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:53.160
He is no ordinary man.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:55.340
Kai!

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:59.000
Sounds fun. I'll watch and see how it goes.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:07.400
I don't care how he did it! I can't forgive someone who would treat Beys like this!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:12.260
Okay! Go... Shoot!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.470
It's fighting on the same level as Dragoon?!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.600
He really <i>isn't</i> your average Blader!

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.660
I need to record this battle!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:32.020
Heh, not bad at all!

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.670
But you'll regret it before long!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.860
Go, Dragoon!

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.180
I'm onto you!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.710
Is that all you've got?

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:51.440
What?!

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.990
Dragoon is being pushed back!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.430
Just how powerful is this guy?!

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.190
Dragoon..!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:09.480
All bark and no bite.
As I thought, this was a waste of time.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.280
Don't give up!

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:16.770
This jerk..! I didn't want to use it
on him, but he leaves me no choice.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:20.040
Go! Phantom Hurricane!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.480
End it, Dragoon!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.760
Who would've thought that someone as lowly as you would have a Sacred Beast?

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:49.110
This guy can see Seiryuu?!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.140
Regardless, an attack of this nature is meaningless.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:55.880
This is what it means to control a Sacred Beast!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.080
Griffolyon!

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:03.960
What?!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.500
T-That's a..!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.460
A Sacred Beast?!

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.720
What's with that Sacred Beast?!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.890
What the heck?! What
in the world <i>is</i> this monster?!

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.930
Attack, Griffolyon!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.740
T-The Sacred Beasts..!

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:28.720
They're fighting against one another!

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:36.820
Dragoon!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.600
Seiryuu stopped moving!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:43.920
Takao, get it together!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:49.120
What... What's with this Sacred Beast..?

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:50.720
Now! Finish him!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.200
Dragoon..!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:19.910
You lose, Takao Kinomiya.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.960
I must compliment you on being
able to dodge my Griffolyon's attack.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:33.220
But at the end of the day, someone like you has no right to control a Sacred Beast.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:39.990
Sacred Beasts are a symbol of true heroism, to be held only by the chosen ones.

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:41.560
You're not worthy.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.090
With that, I take my leave.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:47.530
The party's guests are waiting for me.

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:50.320
Wait.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.850
Who are you?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.160
Ralf Jürgens.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:07.490
Earlier, I was so fixated on the Sacred Beasts that I completely ignored the Beys themselves,

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:12.560
but now I can see that Griffolyon created a blizzard with its incredibly fast rotation.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.010
Dragoon was blown out of the
stadium by its crazy wind pressure.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:23.480
Not making contact with it was
a ray of sunshine in a cloudy sky.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:27.950
If it'd taken that attack head-on, Dragoon would be in the same state as those other Beys.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:29.800
He said his name was Ralf, right?

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.030
Who in the world is this guy?

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:38.770
I don't know, but with that kind of power... we might meet him again in the Final Tournament.

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.280
I ran away.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:45.880
Takao..?

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:50.000
During the battle, I never realized it,

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.300
but I ran from his attack!

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.700
T-That's nothing to worry about, Takao!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.780
Running away is a valid strategy!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:02.260
That's right! If you hadn't run,
Dragoon would currently be...

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:06.280
You don't get it! I got scared... and ran away.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.000
It's the first time I've run away out of fear.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.190
Takao...

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:19.080
How could this happen? Who knew there was somebody like him?!

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:26.080
Who were you thinking you'd
be up against in the finals?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.240
Don't make light of the world's best.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.420
There are many strong opponents yet.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.640
And powerful Sacred Beasts as well.

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.140
Got it, Kai.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.430
Our team is united at last.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:52.700
Our voltage is finally going up in anticipation of the Final Tournament!

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.440
And your seasickness has passed, too.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.200
Now that you mention it...

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:03.700
Professor, make me a new training schedule! I'll do anything you tell me to!

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.990
Very well.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:12.830
Just you wait... I'll fight with everything I have, no matter what opponent I'm facing.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:16.320
And I will stand at the top of the world!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:02.360
According to my analysis, our
journey on the cruise ship... was a mess!

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:07.810
The ship made a stop in England, and... Oh, no! We were left behind!

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:10.280
We can't get in touch with President Daitenji.

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.630
And to make matters worse, a very creepy Blader who controls the Sacred Beast of the Mummy showed up!

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:20.760
Next time: Troubled Journey in Europe!

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:24.430
Ah, there <i>boo</i> are! How was that?
